mechanics:
EVENT QUEUE: logic pushes {n: ++s.evN, t, …} onto s.ev and keeps the last 32. Event types:
- kick {shot, final, rival}
- aim
- nudge
- lockX {x, auto}
- lockY {y, auto}
- strike {res, kind, top, star, pts, slow, replay}
- slow {on}
- result {res, kind, top, star, pts, dive, x, y}
- hype {from, to}
- encore {on}
- boost
- finale {encoreDance, medal}
The 3D view and the 2D fallback each remember the last n they consumed. The view never writes to round.state.
